// Answers an agent ask card (one created by the ask_user tool).
//
// First answer: queued at the FRONT of the session queue as a user message
// "Answer to: <card title>" carrying the ask_card_response attachment, so the
// agent resumes on it (pause still applies; the entry can be reordered or
// removed like any other). Re-answer while still queued: the queued entry's
// attachment is replaced. Re-answer after it was sent: the persisted answer is
// updated in place and no new turn starts.
//
// By default the queued answer carries turn_options.disable_tools ("answer and
// stop": the agent replies but runs no tools). Set continue_with_tools to let
// the answer's turn use tools ("answer and continue"). Only the first answer's
